<title>USA: JTS says Prezioso named CFO.</title>
<headline>JTS says Prezioso named CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>JTS Corp said Joseph Prezioso, the company's vice president and corporate controller, was promoted to chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Prior to joining JTS, Prezioso spent twelve years at International Business Machines Corp where he held various positions in external reporting, financial planning and cost accounting.</p>
<p>A spokesperson was unavailable to provide further details on whom Prezioso was replacing.</p>
